{"id":70558,"date":"2026-10-23T16:50:07","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T15:50:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70558"},"modified":"2026-10-23T16:52:58","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T15:52:58","slug":"sao-silvestre-beja","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-beja\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Beja 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Beja 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Beja 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>26 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partidas e chegadas instaladas na <strong>Rua Gomes Palma<\/strong>, no centro da cidade de <strong>Beja<\/strong>. Promovida e organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Beja<\/strong> (Servi\u00e7o de Desporto) com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e de arbitragem da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Beja<\/strong>, esta emblem\u00e1tica festa desportiva noturna alia a competi\u00e7\u00e3o de estrada ao esp\u00edrito comunit\u00e1rio e solid\u00e1rio, revertendo os donativos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na totalidade a favor do centro de acolhimento de crian\u00e7as <strong>\u00abA Buganv\u00edlia\u00bb<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>18:45<\/strong> com os cinco escal\u00f5es da <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Jovem<\/strong> (dos 300 m para Benjamins A Sub-10 at\u00e9 aos 2.500 m para Juvenis Sub-18), prosseguindo \u00e0s <strong>19:45<\/strong> com a <strong>Caminhada guiada de 5 km<\/strong> pelas art\u00e9rias da cidade. \u00c0s <strong>20:00<\/strong> \u00e9 dado o tiro de partida conjunto para a prova rainha <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km<\/strong> e para a <strong>Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 6,6 km<\/strong> (disputadas num circuito urbano fechado de 3,33 km sem tr\u00e2nsito autom\u00f3vel), organizadas em tr\u00eas setores de partida por tempos de refer\u00eancia (Setor 1: 25&#8217;\u201335&#8242;; Setor 2: 36&#8217;\u201345&#8242;; Setor 3: +46&#8242;) e com tempo limite de <strong>1h40<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O levantamento do kit de atleta (t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal com chip e seguro desportivo) decorre na <strong>Rua Capit\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o Francisco de Sousa, n\u00ba 29<\/strong>, nos dias <strong>23 e 26 de dezembro, das 09:00 \u00e0s 18:00<\/strong>. Todos os participantes contam com pr\u00e9mio finisher na meta, abastecimento l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido (com refrescamento interm\u00e9dio aos 5 km nos 10 km) e acesso a banhos no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo Jo\u00e3o Serra Magalh\u00e3es<\/strong> (Avenida do Brasil). A cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dio realiza-se \u00e0s <strong>21:30<\/strong>, distribuindo pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios nos 10 km para os 6 primeiros da geral M\/F (de <strong>600 \u20ac<\/strong> ao 1\u00ba a <strong>100 \u20ac<\/strong> ao 6\u00ba), acumul\u00e1veis com pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios por escal\u00e3o (60 \u20ac a 20 \u20ac at\u00e9 ao 5\u00ba lugar) e por equipas (250 \u20ac, 150 \u20ac e 100 \u20ac). Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8;