 PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre Beja 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A S\u00e3o Silvestre Beja 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de dezembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Rua Gomes Palma, em Beja, sob organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Beja e colabora\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Beja.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas da S\u00e3o Silvestre Jovem iniciam-se \u00e0s 18:45 (Benjamins A 300 m \u00e0s 18:45, Benjamins B 500 m \u00e0s 18:50, Infantis 1.000 m \u00e0s 18:55, Iniciados 1.500 m \u00e0s 19:05 e Juvenis 2.500 m \u00e0s 19:20). A Caminhada de 5 km parte \u00e0s 19:45, e a S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km e Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 6,6 km partem em conjunto \u00e0s 20:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o e prazo das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem online at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 do dia 20 de dezembro de 2026. O custo \u00e9 de 7,50 \u20ac para a S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km, Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 6,6 km e Caminhada 5 km (incluindo t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal e pr\u00e9mio finisher), sendo gratuita para os escal\u00f5es da S\u00e3o Silvestre Jovem.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando posso levantar o kit de participante e dorsal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega dos kits de participa\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se nos dias 23 e 26 de dezembro de 2026, entre as 09:00 e as 18:00, no secretariado instalado na Rua Capit\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o Francisco de Sousa, n\u00ba 29, em Beja.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios atribu\u00eddos na prova de 10 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na prova oficial de 10 km s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 6 primeiros da geral masculina e feminina (600 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 500 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 400 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba, 300 \u20ac ao 4\u00ba, 200 \u20ac ao 5\u00ba e 100 \u20ac ao 6\u00ba), acumul\u00e1veis com os pr\u00e9mios dos 5 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (60 \u20ac a 20 \u20ac) e das 3 melhores equipas masculinas e femininas (250 \u20ac, 150 \u20ac e 100 \u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre Beja 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-26\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Rua Gomes Palma, Beja\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Beja\", \"addressRegion\": \"Beja\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A S\u00e3o Silvestre Beja 2026 realiza-se a 26 de dezembro em Beja, com Corrida 10 km, Mini 6,6 km, Caminhada 5 km e Provas Jovens. Consulta o guia e inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-beja.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km\", \"price\": \"7.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-beja-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 6,6 km\", \"price\": \"7.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availabilit